window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/comm-v28-080-fd068d29131bb299.json"]={sha256:"fd068d29131bb2991d8d3d6633b7233a5187f63c8a64fb7d040de658bf3c0e4f",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v28-case-12394b4a22706b67","url":"https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/6-450-principles-of-digital-communications-i-fall-2006/","title":"Principles of Digital Communications I","titleEn":"Principles of Digital Communications I","publisher":"MIT OpenCourseWare","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-080","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-080","related":[{"id":"comm-v28-081","referenceUrls":["https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/145000_145099/145002/15.02.00_60/ts_145002v150200p.pdf"],"title":"GSM TDMA：時槽與保護時間排程","titleEn":"GSM TDMA: slot and guard-time scheduling","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付物能重現 8 bit/s/Hz 與 4.95419631039 bit/s/Hz，保留失敗情境且每個通過判定有明確門檻；需分開列出模型未涵蓋的實際系統驗證。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: The artifacts must reproduce 8 bit/s/Hz and 4.95419631039 bit/s/Hz, preserve failing scenarios and attach a threshold to each pass decision; list actual-system validation outside this model separately.","difference":"能推導並解釋4560 microsecond/frame與4320 microsecond/frame，建立tdma_slots.csv、到達偏移表、保護時間驗收，並完成以下驗收：若到達不確定度45 microsecond，30的保護時間不能接受；60的配置須另付出資料時間成本。","differenceEn":"Derive and explain 4560 microsecond/frame and 4320 microsecond/frame; create tdma_slots.csv, arrival offsets and guard-time acceptance; apply this acceptance decision: At45 microseconds arrival uncertainty, guard30 fails; guard60 incurs the explicit data-time cost.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["從原理 平行獨立模態的理想容量可相加sum log2(1+SNRi)；增加天線不保證通道滿秩，需固定總功率。 展開基準式 log2(1+15)+log2(1+15)；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：分開計算每模態貢獻並驗總SNR均30；第二特徵值為零時不得仍算兩條資料流。 將兩條推導一起存入 mimo_modes.csv、奇異值/功率表、逐模態容量。","從原理 TDMA以互不重疊的時槽分配共用媒介；資料時間須扣保護時間，時槽數與語音淨位元率不可直接等同。 展開基準式 8*(600-30)；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：列8個槽的起訖與資料區，總框長4800 microsecond不變；確認無資料跨越保護邊界。 將兩條推導一起存入 tdma_slots.csv、到達偏移表、保護時間驗收。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Starting from Ideal independent-mode capacities add as sum log2(1+SNRi); extra antennas do not guarantee rank and total power must be fixed., expand baseline expression log2(1+15)+log2(1+15); record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Calculate each mode separately and confirm total SNR30; a zero second eigenvalue cannot support a second data stream. Save both derivations with mimo_modes.csv, singular-value/power table and per-mode capacity.","Starting from TDMA divides a shared medium into nonoverlapping slots; guard time reduces data time and slot count is not a voice payload rate., expand baseline expression 8*(600-30); record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: List start/end/data intervals for eight slots; total frame duration remains4800 microseconds and no data crosses a guard boundary. Save both derivations with tdma_slots.csv, arrival offsets and guard-time acceptance.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"comm-v28-090","referenceUrls":["https://www.itu.int/epublications/publication/recommendation-itu-r-m-2012-7-02-2026-detailed-specifications-of-the-terrestrial-radio-interfaces-of-international-mobile-telecommunications-advanced-imt-advanced"],"title":"LTE-M DRX：睡眠節能與等待延遲","titleEn":"LTE-M DRX: sleep energy and waiting delay","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付物能重現 8 bit/s/Hz 與 4.95419631039 bit/s/Hz，保留失敗情境且每個通過判定有明確門檻；需分開列出模型未涵蓋的實際系統驗證。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: The artifacts must reproduce 8 bit/s/Hz and 4.95419631039 bit/s/Hz, preserve failing scenarios and attach a threshold to each pass decision; list actual-system validation outside this model separately.","difference":"能推導並解釋10.9 mW與2.98 mW，建立drx_states.csv、能量積分、最壞等待條件，並完成以下驗收：若需求500 ms最壞等待，兩者皆不可直接接受，必須縮短週期；只看平均功率會誤判。","differenceEn":"Derive and explain 10.9 mW and 2.98 mW; create drx_states.csv, energy integration and worst-wait criteria; apply this acceptance decision: Neither meets a500 ms worst-case wait requirement; shorten the cycle instead of judging only average power.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["從原理 平行獨立模態的理想容量可相加sum log2(1+SNRi)；增加天線不保證通道滿秩，需固定總功率。 展開基準式 log2(1+15)+log2(1+15)；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：分開計算每模態貢獻並驗總SNR均30；第二特徵值為零時不得仍算兩條資料流。 將兩條推導一起存入 mimo_modes.csv、奇異值/功率表、逐模態容量。","從原理 週期性喚醒的平均功率是狀態功率按時間加權；均勻到達時等待平均約睡眠窗口一半，非零延遲。 展開基準式 100*0.1+1*0.9；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：將一週期能量除以週期長度重算；另列最大等待900與980 ms，不將節能等同即時性。 將兩條推導一起存入 drx_states.csv、能量積分、最壞等待條件。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Starting from Ideal independent-mode capacities add as sum log2(1+SNRi); extra antennas do not guarantee rank and total power must be fixed., expand baseline expression log2(1+15)+log2(1+15); record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Calculate each mode separately and confirm total SNR30; a zero second eigenvalue cannot support a second data stream. Save both derivations with mimo_modes.csv, singular-value/power table and per-mode capacity.","Starting from Periodic wake power is time-weighted state power; uniformly arriving traffic waits roughly half the sleep interval rather than zero time., expand baseline expression 100*0.1+1*0.9; record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Divide per-cycle energy by cycle duration; separately record maximum waits900/980 ms rather than equating savings with immediacy. Save both derivations with drx_states.csv, energy integration and worst-wait criteria.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v28-case-b12237ac3fc60f0b","url":"https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/145000_145099/145002/15.02.00_60/ts_145002v150200p.pdf","title":"ETSI TS 145 002 V15.2.0: GSM/EDGE Multiplexing and multiple access","titleEn":"ETSI TS 145 002 V15.2.0: GSM/EDGE Multiplexing and multiple access","publisher":"ETSI / 3GPP","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v28-case-54c0b2f5304c0c3c","url":"https://www.itu.int/epublications/publication/recommendation-itu-r-m-2012-7-02-2026-detailed-specifications-of-the-terrestrial-radio-interfaces-of-international-mobile-telecommunications-advanced-imt-advanced","title":"ITU-R M.2012-7: LTE-Advanced radio-interface specification","titleEn":"ITU-R M.2012-7: LTE-Advanced radio-interface specification","publisher":"ITU","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
